From: Chukun Pan <amadeus@jmu.edu.cn>

commit 55645e4f3c6022ffb160ad3617d2b624eaa38501 upstream.

Add support for the TDTECH MT5710-CN (5G redcap) module based on the
Huawei HiSilicon Balong chip.

